{"stored_at": "2026-03-12T06:51:36.878168", "expires_at": "2026-03-13T06:51:36.878168", "value": {"type": "game", "name": "Rewind 99", "steam_appid": 3977290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You’re not just running a video rental store.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You’re running out of time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/6a0ebbfc0a611d4bc7f89ef32461de88.poster.avif?t=1773252323\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/6a0ebbfc0a611d4bc7f89ef32461de88.webm?t=1773252323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/6a0ebbfc0a611d4bc7f89ef32461de88.mp4?t=1773252323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>RUN THE WORLD'S LAST VIDEO RENTAL STORE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve inherited the last video rental store in town. You're broke, drowning in late returns, and streaming giant RentNet just opened across the street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your store by day.<br>Do whatever it takes to survive by night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay in business, the more chaotic things become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR STORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order movies, snacks, toys, and rare collectibles. Stock shelves, manage customers, and expand your store from a dying shop into a thriving business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees, automate operations, and optimize every inch of your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision determines whether you survive another week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and did we mention we have PLENTY of store customization options?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/fed17af0a293260475d097d0f1419687.poster.avif?t=1773252323\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/fed17af0a293260475d097d0f1419687.webm?t=1773252323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/fed17af0a293260475d097d0f1419687.mp4?t=1773252323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/ac288f6d0e18d540ebc2a5c4c56a4e71.poster.avif?t=1773252323\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/ac288f6d0e18d540ebc2a5c4c56a4e71.webm?t=1773252323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/ac288f6d0e18d540ebc2a5c4c56a4e71.mp4?t=1773252323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUSTLE TO SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store alone isn’t enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run underground fight clubs. Gamble on scratcher tickets. Install a claw machine. Take on shady side hustles across the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will make you rich.<br>Some will ruin you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/278bf96be9b76fd7cbdf821eda95d214.poster.avif?t=1773252323\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/278bf96be9b76fd7cbdf821eda95d214.webm?t=1773252323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/278bf96be9b76fd7cbdf821eda95d214.mp4?t=1773252323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/18c6696db5232b33c91b5ad85b7f926e.poster.avif?t=1773252323\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/18c6696db5232b33c91b5ad85b7f926e.webm?t=1773252323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/18c6696db5232b33c91b5ad85b7f926e.mp4?t=1773252323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR OWN FILM EMPIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce and release your own original films to compete with RentNet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage production, release films, and turn your store into something far bigger than a rental shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/9bf9d2dc4e08aa654834ce4d55851d9a.poster.avif?t=1773252323\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/9bf9d2dc4e08aa654834ce4d55851d9a.webm?t=1773252323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977290/extras/9bf9d2dc4e08aa654834ce4d55851d9a.mp4?t=1773252323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A CITY FULL OF OPPORTUNITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\